        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha walifuata watu wa ukoo wa Kohathi, wakiwa wamebeba vyombo vitakatifu. Walipowasili, hema lilikuwa limekwisha simikwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baada ya hao, walifuata watu waliokuwa chini ya bendera ya kikosi kilichoongozwa na kabila la Efraimu, kundi moja baada ya jingine. Kiongozi wao alikuwa Elishama mwana wa Amihudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gamalieli mwana wa Pedasuri aliliongoza kabila la Manase, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naye Abidani mwana wa Gideoni, aliliongoza kabila la Benyamini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwisho, wale waliokuwa chini ya bendera ya kikosi kilichoongozwa na kabila la Dani, waliokuwa kama walinzi nyuma ya vikosi vyote, walisafiri, kundi moja baada ya jingine. Hawa waliongozwa na Ahiezeri mwana wa Amishadai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pagieli, mwana wa Okrani, aliliongoza kabila la Asheri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Ahira mwana wa Enani, aliliongoza kabila la Naftali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huu basi, ndio utaratibu walioufuata Waisraeli kulingana na makundi yao, kila wakati walipovunja kambi na kuanza kusafiri tena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose alimwambia shemeji yake, Hobabu mwana wa Reueli, Mmidiani, mkwe wake, “Sisi tunasafiri kwenda mahali ambapo Mwenyezi-Mungu amesema ‘Nitawapa nyinyi mahali hapo’. Basi, twende pamoja, nasi tutakutendea mema; maana Mwenyezi-Mungu ameahidi kutupa sisi Waisraeli fanaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Hobabu akajibu, “Mimi sitafuatana nanyi; ila nitarudi katika nchi yangu na kwa jamaa zangu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose akamwambia, “Tafadhali usituache, maana wewe unajua mahali tunapoweza kupiga kambi jangwani, na unaweza kuwa kiongozi wetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tena ukiandamana nasi chochote chema atakachotutendea Mwenyezi-Mungu, ndicho utakachotendewa nawe pia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, watu wakasafiri toka Sinai, Mlima wa Mwenyezi-Mungu, mwendo wa siku tatu. Sanduku la agano la Mwenyezi-Mungu liliwatangulia mwendo wa siku tatu, ili kuwatafutia mahali pa kupiga kambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kila waliposafiri kutoka kambi moja hadi nyingine, wingu la Mwenyezi-Mungu lilikuwa juu yao mchana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
