          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Zab 68:1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kila wakati sanduku liliposafiri kwenda mbele, Mose alisema, “Inuka, ee Mwenyezi-Mungu, uwatawanye adui zako, na hao wanaokuchukia uwafanye wakimbie kutoka mbele yako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kila wakati liliposimama, Mose alisema, “Warudie, ee Mwenyezi-Mungu, hawa maelfu na maelfu ya Israeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
